# EAS upload excludes for THIS project root (void-app). Because app.json + eas.json
# live here, run `eas build` from inside void-app/ so EAS roots the archive here and
# the repo-root .easignore (which excludes /The Void/) does NOT apply.
#
# Note on the nested git: `The Void/.git` exists. If EAS's VCS archiver picks it up and
# treats void-app as untracked, set `EAS_NO_VCS=1` (or eas.json cli.requireCommit=false)
# so EAS archives the working directory instead of the git tree. See README.

node_modules/
.expo/
dist/
web-build/
*.log
.git/

# Never upload secrets / signing material
.env
*.keystore
*.p8
*.p12
*.mobileprovision
google-service-account*.json

# Legacy WebView-shell artefact (generated by ../build.js for the hosted web
# build). The native app never loads it.
assets/void.html
native-modules-disabled/
store/screenshots/
